1
00:00:00,183 --> 00:00:01,789
What happens if the CIA turns

2
00:00:01,799 --> 00:00:03,165
a cat into a spy?

3
00:00:03,175 --> 00:00:04,745
In the nineteen sixties,

4
00:00:04,755 --> 00:00:05,810
they found out.

5
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:07,574
The target was the Soviets.

6
00:00:07,584 --> 00:00:09,073
The problem was getting close.

7
00:00:09,083 --> 00:00:10,977
But a cat can go anywhere,

8
00:00:10,987 --> 00:00:12,430
and nobody looks twice.

9
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:14,205
So surgeons hid a microphone in

10
00:00:14,215 --> 00:00:16,046
its ear, a transmitter at the

11
00:00:16,056 --> 00:00:17,027
base of its skull,

12
00:00:17,037 --> 00:00:19,320
and an antenna in its fur.

13
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:20,362
Years of work.

14
00:00:20,372 --> 00:00:22,048
Millions of dollars.

15
00:00:22,058 --> 00:00:23,446
Then came the first mission.

16
00:00:23,456 --> 00:00:24,937
A park in Washington,

17
00:00:24,947 --> 00:00:26,427
outside a Soviet compound.

18
00:00:26,437 --> 00:00:27,997
Two men on a bench.

19
00:00:28,007 --> 00:00:29,498
The cat had one job:

20
00:00:29,508 --> 00:00:31,722
listen. But the cat didn't care.

21
00:00:31,732 --> 00:00:33,298
You see, the CIA could train

22
00:00:33,308 --> 00:00:34,756
it to walk short distances.

23
00:00:34,766 --> 00:00:36,096
It could not make it want

24
00:00:36,106 --> 00:00:37,930
to. A cat does what a

25
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:39,941
cat wants. So the agents wrote

26
00:00:39,951 --> 00:00:41,373
their final report.

27
00:00:41,383 --> 00:00:42,657
Cats can be trained to move

28
00:00:42,667 --> 00:00:43,503
a short way,

29
00:00:43,513 --> 00:00:45,029
it said. But in a real

30
00:00:45,039 --> 00:00:46,537
foreign operation, quote,

31
00:00:46,547 --> 00:00:48,206
"it would not be practical."

32
00:00:48,216 --> 00:00:50,223
In nineteen sixty-seven,

33
00:00:50,233 --> 00:00:51,801
the project was cancelled.

34
00:00:51,811 --> 00:00:53,192
The CIA built a spy out

35
00:00:53,202 --> 00:00:54,156
of a cat.

36
00:00:54,166 --> 00:00:55,449
It just forgot the cat had

37
00:00:55,459 --> 00:00:56,000
to agree.
